WEBVTT

00:04.871 --> 00:12.073
Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~

00:13.246 --> 00:19.981
No matter where
you are, I'll find you.

00:21.388 --> 00:28.419
I can only watch you...
I can't even talk to you.

00:28.528 --> 00:32.988
Today is going to end,
and we can't see tomorrow.

00:33.566 --> 00:36.194
But they'll turn into a gentle color.

00:37.837 --> 00:44.299
It whirls down from
the sky... Love will shine.

00:44.778 --> 00:52.810
<i>When I turn around,
I always see your smile.</i>

00:54.120 --> 01:01.526
1 wish a day like that would come.

01:01.761 --> 01:09.600
I want to keep
looking at you up close.

01:10.370 --> 01:16.832
I'm sending these great
feelings that never end...

01:17.043 --> 01:22.003
...straight to you.

02:34.988 --> 02:39.925
Will This Wish Come True?

02:43.062 --> 02:44.029
Huh?

02:47.167 --> 02:50.864
Your boobs are soft like
a pillow, so comfortable, puu...

02:54.874 --> 02:56.341
What's going on?

02:56.509 --> 02:57.908
Menu
Lunch / Drinks

02:58.311 --> 03:00.370
Um...

03:02.916 --> 03:06.215
Why don't you just order
a juice or something?

03:06.686 --> 03:08.950
Yeah, that's a good idea.

03:09.322 --> 03:10.856
This parfait is also good.

03:10.857 --> 03:12.848
This parfait is also good.
Well...

03:19.032 --> 03:19.999
Hazumu!

03:20.500 --> 03:21.865
Not again...

03:22.202 --> 03:25.638
You've always been indecisive...

03:32.178 --> 03:36.308
That's right. There's a summer
festival at Kashima Shrine today.

03:39.452 --> 03:41.545
I'm going to win again.

03:41.754 --> 03:43.085
Win what?

03:43.356 --> 03:45.790
She's talking about a Shinto ritual.

03:45.925 --> 03:48.291
I know about the festival, but...

03:48.394 --> 03:51.955
It's a ritual performed at
Kashima Shrine. It's pretty simple.

03:52.332 --> 03:56.564
There are two wooden bowls,
face down. If you pick the right one...

03:56.669 --> 03:59.137
...then your wish will come true.

03:59.272 --> 04:00.432
I see...

04:00.573 --> 04:02.507
You're all going, right?

04:02.609 --> 04:03.735
1 am.

04:03.843 --> 04:06.141
<i>Yeah, I might want to go too.</i>

04:06.679 --> 04:09.113
Hazumu, you're going too, right?

04:09.649 --> 04:10.946
The festival?

04:13.853 --> 04:15.650
Sure, I'll go!

04:15.955 --> 04:18.515
Then we'll all be in yukata, right?

04:22.028 --> 04:24.861
I wonder what you'll
be wearing, Hazumu...

04:24.964 --> 04:28.195
A girl's yukata in my house is...

04:30.737 --> 04:32.398
...a sure thing.

04:33.773 --> 04:35.331
Then it's settled.

04:35.441 --> 04:37.932
But do you think I'll look good?

04:38.444 --> 04:39.775
No problem!

04:41.581 --> 04:44.482
Hazumu, you can wear
anything and look good!

04:44.584 --> 04:46.415
I guarantee it.

04:46.719 --> 04:48.209
You were here?

04:48.421 --> 04:50.651
I was here! Of course I was!

04:50.757 --> 04:54.454
<i>I was in the next booth,
but I was here all this time!</i>

04:54.560 --> 04:57.085
Forget that. Why is he here?

04:57.196 --> 04:59.687
You're right. Nobody invited him.

04:59.866 --> 05:01.493
W-Well...

05:03.770 --> 05:06.705
I get it. You must
have lots of free time.

05:08.608 --> 05:11.270
You people don't like me!

05:11.377 --> 05:13.402
Damn! You just wait!

05:13.513 --> 05:17.074
Meet me at the front gate
of the shrine at 6! Got it?

05:19.786 --> 05:20.686
Asuta...

05:20.687 --> 05:21.984
Asuta...
Well...

05:22.388 --> 05:24.720
Don't worry about him.
He's just an idiot.

05:24.824 --> 05:28.954
Setting something up just like that.
You can't look down on him.

05:29.062 --> 05:31.690
We can put that aside for now...

05:32.398 --> 05:35.492
What kind of yukata
will you wear, Tomari?

05:36.135 --> 05:38.933
I'm not going to wear a yukata...

05:39.205 --> 05:41.139
What? You won't?

05:41.441 --> 05:42.840
Well, you know...

05:43.142 --> 05:45.235
It's me we're talking about.

05:45.812 --> 05:48.576
<i>I want to see you in a yukata.</i>

05:51.818 --> 05:52.944
Let's go...

05:53.786 --> 05:55.754
<i>But I haven't ordered yet...</i>

05:55.855 --> 05:57.789
I don't care. I'm leaving.

05:58.891 --> 06:02.759
Well, let's leave then.
We'll see each other again later.

06:02.929 --> 06:05.363
The shrine's front gate at 5.

06:05.465 --> 06:06.432
Okay.

06:06.966 --> 06:09.332
Got it. 5 PM, right?

06:10.636 --> 06:11.762
5 PM?

06:13.773 --> 06:15.104
Mother!

06:15.742 --> 06:17.107
Welcome home, Tomari.

06:17.210 --> 06:19.906
Buy me a yukata! A real cute one!

06:25.885 --> 06:28.854
My sister's gone crazy from the heat!

06:28.955 --> 06:30.354
Hello, honey?

06:30.456 --> 06:35.223
Forget work and come home right
now! Tomari is saying girly things!

06:35.328 --> 06:37.523
<i>Who do you think I am?</i>

06:37.830 --> 06:40.492
<i>Forget it! I won't ask you! Damn!</i>

06:41.567 --> 06:42.966
This looks good.

06:43.369 --> 06:45.428
This one's not bad either.

06:50.343 --> 06:53.073
But ll guess I'll have to go with this.

06:56.015 --> 06:58.142
Hazumu in a yukata...

06:58.484 --> 07:00.975
A date with Hazumu in a yukata...

07:14.066 --> 07:17.729
I finally got a perfect yukata.

07:18.204 --> 07:21.696
I'm sure Mr. Sora will be happy...

07:22.108 --> 07:25.669
Namiko, you look
great in a yukata as well.

07:25.978 --> 07:27.275
Hitoshi!

07:27.647 --> 07:29.945
<i>I just want to spin you around!</i>

07:31.050 --> 07:33.109
You're playing with me!

07:33.586 --> 07:36.555
I want to keep spinning
you around and around!

07:36.656 --> 07:37.987
You're wonderful!

07:38.090 --> 07:41.082
I want to keep on
spinning you more and more!

07:41.227 --> 07:43.354
Keep spinning me more!

07:48.067 --> 07:50.001
1 feel sick.

07:54.740 --> 07:56.708
5,800 yen...

07:57.243 --> 07:59.438
Do you have anything cheaper?

07:59.545 --> 08:01.706
I'm afraid that we don't.

08:01.814 --> 08:03.805
I guess you're right...

08:08.454 --> 08:12.083
ll shouldn't have bought new shoes.

08:13.326 --> 08:14.384
Welcome.

08:15.962 --> 08:18.863
Could you show
me your yukata obi...

08:19.966 --> 08:21.194
Tomari?

08:21.300 --> 08:22.267
Yo.

08:22.768 --> 08:24.395
What are you buying?

08:24.504 --> 08:27.166
Well, I...

08:31.244 --> 08:33.007
Okay, look this way!

08:33.145 --> 08:35.136
Yes, that's it!

08:36.048 --> 08:37.606
Smile for me!

08:41.821 --> 08:44.415
<i>I knew this was going to happen.</i>

08:44.724 --> 08:45.691
Hazumu!

08:46.659 --> 08:48.627
Yes! Perfect!

08:49.128 --> 08:52.188
Now let's loosen that neck area.

08:52.298 --> 08:53.424
Like this?

08:53.566 --> 08:54.760
You!

08:57.770 --> 08:59.101
All righty...

09:01.774 --> 09:04.743
Girls look good in pink after all.

09:04.844 --> 09:06.573
Now wear this one.

09:06.679 --> 09:09.807
You look very lovely
in pink, Sister Brother!

09:13.386 --> 09:14.785
This is it.

09:15.955 --> 09:18.480
Summer, shrines, romance...

09:18.658 --> 09:19.647
ll see.

09:20.660 --> 09:23.390
In other words,
summer festivals are about...

09:23.496 --> 09:25.828
...a romantic time behind the shrine?

09:25.932 --> 09:28.765
He's coming up
with something odd again.

09:29.201 --> 09:31.362
I'm expecting great things.

09:31.470 --> 09:34.735
Looks like some people
went through those things...

09:36.742 --> 09:39.233
How about it?
Like father, like daughter.

09:39.345 --> 09:40.573
How so?

09:40.680 --> 09:44.980
You'll be with Yasuna Kamiizumi
and Tomari Kurusu, won't you?

09:45.084 --> 09:46.574
It's perfect.

09:48.654 --> 09:53.523
<i>Speaking of festivals, I remember
Hazumu came home crying once.</i>

09:54.527 --> 09:56.654
<i>Yes, I remember.</i>

09:56.796 --> 09:59.959
Cried all night long...
I didn't know what to do.

10:00.399 --> 10:02.492
Are you sure about that?

10:02.602 --> 10:04.001
You don't recall?

10:04.103 --> 10:07.368
Grumbling about
cotton candy into the next day...

10:07.473 --> 10:09.373
That's right.

10:09.809 --> 10:12.334
Hazumu, you really don't remember?

10:12.445 --> 10:14.003
Cotton candy...

10:19.418 --> 10:20.817
Sister Brother!

10:20.920 --> 10:23.081
Smile! Smile more!

10:23.689 --> 10:24.883
Jun Puu.

10:25.191 --> 10:29.218
We're going to a festival!
But smiles should be free!

10:29.328 --> 10:31.796
You're right. Let's have lots of fun.

10:31.897 --> 10:33.330
I agree!

10:35.134 --> 10:37.193
Done. Look in the mirror.

10:37.370 --> 10:38.530
Okay...

10:44.644 --> 10:49.604
Sorry about all this. I feel like
I forced you to let me borrow this.

10:49.715 --> 10:53.947
Not at all. We help
each other in times of need.

10:54.053 --> 10:56.988
<i>Plus I wanted
to thank you for last time.</i>

10:58.691 --> 11:01.353
For inviting me to the test of courage.

11:01.460 --> 11:04.896
That was nothing... nothing special...

11:04.997 --> 11:07.192
We went to the beach too.

11:07.299 --> 11:09.927
Wouldn't it be weird
if ll didn't invite you?

11:10.036 --> 11:11.003
But...

11:14.006 --> 11:17.703
You hate seeing me
with Hazumu, don't you?

11:20.813 --> 11:24.442
You feel the same way, right?
When I'm with Hazumu...

11:24.550 --> 11:25.517
Well...

11:26.519 --> 11:30.785
I met Hazumu
much later than all of you...

11:30.923 --> 11:33.551
It doesn't matter when you met!

11:39.498 --> 11:43.400
I'm sure we're thinking
about the same thing.

11:45.071 --> 11:46.333
Tomari-san...

11:47.440 --> 11:51.433
<i>I don't know how to say this, but...</i>

11:52.144 --> 11:55.045
Let's go to the festival together.

11:55.481 --> 11:56.607
Okay.

12:00.686 --> 12:02.554
And don't call me Tomari-san!

12:02.555 --> 12:04.250
And don't call me Tomari-san!
Oh, I'm sorry.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.069
Wow!

12:31.083 --> 12:33.517
Look at all the stands!

12:33.619 --> 12:34.813
<i>Puu, puu, puu!</i>

12:35.221 --> 12:38.247
They both have
the same look on their faces...

12:38.357 --> 12:40.655
Hey, where should we go first?

12:40.760 --> 12:43.923
There's no need to rush.
They're not going anywhere.

12:44.396 --> 12:45.795
You're right.

12:46.098 --> 12:49.465
But there is a chance
they'll run out of things...

12:49.568 --> 12:52.196
You're so mean, Ayuki...

12:52.304 --> 12:54.864
You shouldn't
be mean like that, puu!

12:56.609 --> 12:58.372
You're so mean!

13:03.783 --> 13:05.518
Maybe it was just my imagination.

13:05.518 --> 13:08.453
Maybe it was just my imagination.
Let's go. Before they're all gone.

13:08.554 --> 13:09.521
Okay!

13:14.393 --> 13:18.090
I was a little worried
about Hazumu this afternoon.

13:18.197 --> 13:20.256
Um, me too.

13:20.866 --> 13:23.767
I guess we were thinking
the same thing again.

13:23.869 --> 13:25.461
You're right.

13:29.375 --> 13:32.071
The joy of gazing... That is love.

13:35.781 --> 13:38.079
<i>I guess it's better not to worry...</i>

13:38.184 --> 13:39.481
Yeah.

13:42.521 --> 13:43.488
Huh?

13:44.423 --> 13:46.755
I feel like I'm forgetting something...

13:46.859 --> 13:47.917
Oh well...

13:52.498 --> 13:55.729
No mistake!
Hazumu is talking about me!

13:55.835 --> 13:59.134
She just can't stop
liking me as a friend.

13:59.238 --> 14:03.607
That's the cute thing about her...
I don't know what to say!

14:08.547 --> 14:13.314
Guys have to be waiting 30 minutes
before the meeting time with a girl.

14:13.419 --> 14:16.217
And when she sees
me waiting, she'll be like...

14:16.322 --> 14:18.085
Asuta!

14:18.190 --> 14:19.555
Hazumu!

14:22.094 --> 14:23.061
Easy...

14:23.796 --> 14:25.661
Are you okay, Hazumu?

14:25.764 --> 14:30.167
<i>Sorry, I wanted to be here early
so I could wait for you, Asuta.</i>

14:30.536 --> 14:32.367
I'm such a bother...

14:32.471 --> 14:35.963
You idiot! It's every
guy's job to wait for a girl!

14:38.978 --> 14:40.104
Asuta...

14:40.412 --> 14:42.539
You're like a prince.

14:43.182 --> 14:44.206
Yeah...

14:44.316 --> 14:47.012
I'm your prince, Princess Hazumu.

14:47.453 --> 14:49.421
I love you, Asuta.

14:49.855 --> 14:50.822
Me too.

14:52.524 --> 14:55.049
I'll make you happy, Hazumu!

14:55.160 --> 14:57.287
Mama, that guy's weird.

14:57.396 --> 14:59.489
Stop looking at him.

15:00.366 --> 15:03.858
Arrangements have been
made for the church, Mr. Sora!

15:04.169 --> 15:06.399
Mama, that lady's weird too.

15:06.505 --> 15:08.370
You shouldn't look at them!

15:08.540 --> 15:10.872
Such a strong chest...

15:14.580 --> 15:16.741
W-Wait for me!

15:20.886 --> 15:22.114
What's wrong?

15:23.455 --> 15:27.118
I didn't know it'd be this hard
to move around in a yukata.

15:27.459 --> 15:30.326
<i>Maybe I shouldn't have worn this...</i>

15:35.834 --> 15:37.995
I guess I don't look good...

15:38.270 --> 15:41.467
Not at all.
It looks really good on you.

15:43.409 --> 15:44.706
Very cute!

15:47.446 --> 15:49.141
Uh, I...

15:49.448 --> 15:50.745
Uh...

15:53.852 --> 15:54.784
Mister!

15:54.887 --> 15:55.876
Sure.

15:59.224 --> 16:02.387
Super special move!
Chaotic Goldfish Catch!

16:05.831 --> 16:06.889
Take it.

16:06.999 --> 16:08.296
Thanks...

16:08.667 --> 16:10.191
She was happy.

16:10.869 --> 16:12.700
They're cute!

16:15.541 --> 16:22.970
The compass is spinning
around and around...

16:24.650 --> 16:32.557
...just like our dreams and love.

16:33.926 --> 16:42.356
After the tears
fall down our cheeks...

16:44.670 --> 16:47.468
I'm getting kind of hungry.

16:47.673 --> 16:49.766
We did have lots of fun...

16:49.875 --> 16:51.968
There's lots of food here.

16:52.077 --> 16:54.568
Okay, I'm going to eat a lot!

16:54.980 --> 16:56.379
Sister Brother!

16:57.216 --> 16:59.980
That fluffy, soft stuff is cute!

17:01.954 --> 17:03.444
Oh, that...

17:03.856 --> 17:05.517
The cotton candy.

17:05.924 --> 17:07.357
Cotton candy...

17:08.627 --> 17:09.992
Sister Brother?

17:11.764 --> 17:12.992
It's nothing.

17:13.832 --> 17:16.767
Which one do you like?
Pink or white?

17:17.403 --> 17:19.871
<i>I want pink!</i>

17:20.372 --> 17:22.670
Which one are you going to get?

17:22.975 --> 17:24.704
<i>Ll.</i>

17:35.521 --> 17:37.921
I choose...

17:40.325 --> 17:44.022
Hazumu, Hazumu, want
do you like apples? some takoyaki?

17:56.942 --> 17:58.876
What's wrong, Hazumu?

17:59.344 --> 18:01.312
You're not feeling well?

18:03.549 --> 18:07.246
It's just... I'm going to the bathroom!

18:21.333 --> 18:23.301
I couldn't decide again...

18:24.203 --> 18:27.604
What happened this
afternoon was the same thing.

18:27.706 --> 18:31.369
I feel like it's been
this way ever since I was little...

18:31.477 --> 18:34.674
I couldn't decide
and ended up being sad.

18:35.347 --> 18:38.510
What's wrong? Your state
of mind seems unstable.

18:40.619 --> 18:42.610
Don't just appear like that!

18:42.721 --> 18:46.487
I thought you were getting all
romantic by the back of the shrine.

18:46.592 --> 18:49.823
I don't see
Yasuna Kamiizumi or Tomari Kurusu.

18:50.028 --> 18:54.692
I started feeling sad after
looking at the cotton candy.

18:55.701 --> 18:57.532
I don't know why...

19:04.476 --> 19:06.034
This is it.

19:08.080 --> 19:10.605
<i>At a festival when I was little...</i>

19:10.716 --> 19:12.877
Which one do you want, Hazumu?

19:12.985 --> 19:13.952
Um...

19:14.386 --> 19:15.353
Um...

19:16.488 --> 19:17.546
Both!

19:17.689 --> 19:20.021
You can't have both.

19:20.292 --> 19:22.419
Pink... White...

19:22.561 --> 19:24.552
Pink... White...

19:29.034 --> 19:31.002
Let's go home, Hazumu!

19:32.538 --> 19:34.563
I want cotton candy!

19:34.940 --> 19:38.000
This is what happens
when you don't choose quickly.

19:38.410 --> 19:40.469
You can't be like this.

19:40.679 --> 19:43.705
You'll regret it when
deciding something important.

19:43.815 --> 19:46.249
Cotton candy!

19:49.388 --> 19:52.687
<i>Pink or white... I couldn't decide...</i>

19:53.692 --> 19:55.990
I was crying all night long.

19:57.763 --> 20:00.561
I've been indecisive since I was little.

20:00.666 --> 20:04.898
<i>And before I knew it, I didn't
end up with anything I wanted...</i>

20:05.270 --> 20:08.330
I was always regretting it.

20:09.141 --> 20:11.302
<i>I knew I had to choose...</i>

20:14.513 --> 20:16.378
If I keep going like this...

20:16.481 --> 20:21.009
...I'll lose something much
more valuable than cotton candy.

20:21.486 --> 20:24.250
I like both Tomari and Yasuna.

20:24.590 --> 20:26.990
<i>But I can't let it be like this.</i>

20:27.759 --> 20:29.818
I have to choose, right?

20:30.729 --> 20:33.960
We can't always
be together like this.

20:34.466 --> 20:37.867
<i>But I still can't choose...</i>

20:42.207 --> 20:43.174
Tomari-san.

20:45.477 --> 20:47.502
Will you hear me out?

20:56.521 --> 20:57.783
Here!

20:58.390 --> 21:00.153
You wanted some, right?

21:00.259 --> 21:02.284
You can have both.

21:02.394 --> 21:03.361
Both?

21:03.462 --> 21:04.724
That's right.

21:13.338 --> 21:14.930
It's so sweet!

21:23.315 --> 21:24.282
Please.

21:24.483 --> 21:25.609
Thank you.

21:34.593 --> 21:37.528
God, my wish right now is...

21:37.829 --> 21:39.126
This one!

21:39.264 --> 21:40.424
I'm sorry.

21:40.732 --> 21:42.199
It can't be!

21:44.403 --> 21:46.064
Cheer up, Hazumu.

21:46.171 --> 21:49.106
It's just a ritual. Don't get too upset.

21:49.574 --> 21:51.565
Yeah, you're right.

21:54.946 --> 21:57.380
Look! They're starting the fireworks!

21:57.482 --> 21:58.847
So pretty!

22:03.822 --> 22:04.914
God...

22:05.424 --> 22:08.018
I know I'm dishonest and selfish...

22:09.027 --> 22:12.463
But just for a little...
Just for a little longer...

22:14.399 --> 22:17.129
<i>...want all three of us to be like this.</i>

22:17.235 --> 22:20.033
Can you make this wish come true?

22:22.040 --> 22:23.166
Please...

22:24.543 --> 22:25.669
God...

22:34.252 --> 22:40.350
If it's a never-ending road...

22:40.692 --> 22:47.120
...then we can start again
from here, the new starting line.

22:47.299 --> 22:53.397
<i>Things won't change,
but! want them to change.</i>

22:53.705 --> 23:00.304
My heart aches, and that's
because I'm feeling sad.

23:01.847 --> 23:04.577
Looking for the truth...

23:04.716 --> 23:15.092
I pushed your back
while crying back then.

23:16.395 --> 23:22.595
Let's overcome
the sadness and be happy.

23:22.834 --> 23:29.262
<i>Should I put my trust
in a future that I can't see?</i>

23:29.408 --> 23:35.369
Your gentle eyes
are watching over me.

23:35.847 --> 23:43.151
I'll keep my promise
in order to see your smiley face.

23:45.624 --> 23:49.754
Our future is just around the corner.

23:56.201 --> 23:58.726
<i>I had fun. I was delighted.</i>

23:58.837 --> 24:00.566
I was happy.

24:00.672 --> 24:03.368
<i>Until I saw those two.</i>

24:03.542 --> 24:06.102
